{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1511248001:0":{"text":"巨蛛王……还真是庞然大物。","source_cn":"巨蛛王……还真是庞然大物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBE9F5C22F1C235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511248002:0":{"text":"那、那个……缇洛亚，你真的打得过它吗？","source_cn":"那、那个……缇洛亚，你真的打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7244F4757C2F894E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511248003:0":{"text":"不对。有人打得过它吗？","source_cn":"不对。有人打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE411EA07175EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511248004:0":{"text":"那非曾经战胜过它。","source_cn":"那非曾经战胜过它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA8B6DCDA493514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511248005:0":{"text":"几年前他脱离雅库伯尔时，就是从这个方向离开的。","source_cn":"几年前他脱离雅库伯尔时，就是从这个方向离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF78000B24A9A979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511248006:0":{"text":"但那非是曾经得到过神明恩赐的勇士，缇洛亚就只是——哎哟！","s